Bugfix: Don't reset `stats` progress bar counters for every snapshot

The progress bar of the `stats` command previously reset its file,
blob and size counters at the start of each snapshot, so the final
progress line only showed the numbers for the last processed snapshot.
These numbers varied between runs depending on the order in which
snapshots were processed.

The progress bar now instead counts across all selected snapshots.

